@startuml
title BugBoard26 - Modello persistente Sequelize - Milestone 2
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class User <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -fullName: String
  -email: String
  -passwordHash: String
  -role: Role
  -createdAt: Instant
}
enum Role {
  USER
  ADMIN
}
class Project <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -name: String
  -description: String
  -status: ProjectStatus
  -createdAt: Instant
  -updatedAt: Instant
}
enum ProjectStatus {
  ACTIVE
  ARCHIVED
}
class ProjectMembership <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -project: Project
  -user: User
  -joinedAt: Instant
}
User --> Role
class Issue <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -project: Project
  -reporter: User
  -assignee: User [0..1]
  -title: String
  -description: String
  -type: IssueType
  -priority: IssuePriority
  -status: IssueStatus
  -createdAt: Instant
  -updatedAt: Instant
}
enum IssueStatus {
  OPEN
  IN_PROGRESS
  CLOSED
}
enum IssueType {
  BUG
  FEATURE
  DOCUMENTATION
  QUESTION
}
enum IssuePriority {
  LOW
  MEDIUM
  HIGH
  CRITICAL
}
class IssueComment <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -issue: Issue
  -author: User
  -content: String
  -createdAt: Instant
}
class Notification <<Entity>> {
  -id: Long
  -recipient: User
  -issue: Issue
  -message: String
  -read: boolean
  -createdAt: Instant
}
Project "1" -- "0..*" Issue
User "1" -- "0..*" Issue : reporter
User "0..1" -- "0..*" Issue : assignee
Issue --> IssueStatus
Issue --> IssueType
Issue --> IssuePriority
Issue "1" -- "0..*" IssueComment
User "1" -- "0..*" IssueComment : author
Issue "1" -- "0..*" Notification
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : recipient
note bottom of Issue
  OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS -> CLOSED
  Assegnatario membro del progetto.
  Reporter e autore da identita' JWT.
end note
Project --> ProjectStatus
User "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMembership
Project "1" -- "0..*" ProjectMembership
note bottom of ProjectMembership
  unique(project_id, user_id)
  I privilegi ADMIN sono globali.
end note
legend bottom
  Modello corrente: milestone 1 e 2.
  Sei modelli in backend/src/models/index.js.
  Operazioni nei controller e servizi Express.
endlegend
@enduml
